  "description": "Calahan, a famous hunter who has captured 999 wanted criminals, chooses Johnny the Grifter as the final target of his career for a reward of 10 million pais. But Johnny, a con man who preys on the pockets of the elderly, insists he's innocent... \"If I prove my innocence, you give me a million pais.” Calahan and Johnny embark on a wild ride with a million pais on the line, and a mysterious group of men in hot pursuit. There's only ten days until they reach their destination, and both will do whatever it takes to win the bet - dead or alive.\n\n(Source: Lezhin US)\n\n*Note: Chapter count includes a prologue and an epilogue.*",
